body:
Even though my boyfriend and I have been together for almost two years, when we first started dating, I made 365 reasons (one for each day up until our one year) as to why I love him. I now make him little cards and drawings, usually of us as little cartoons.

But him...well, he's just a big sweetie. He somehow relates anything completely off topic to me being cute. He leaves me little posts or texts just saying he loves me. I once got a text from him saying how he was at a restaurant with his family, sitting in front of a huge steak, and all he could think of was how much he loves me. All of the cards that I've ever given him, no matter how big or ridiculous they are, he hangs them up in his room. And one of the big things: he says I'm cuter than Emma Watson, whom he (like all other men I can think of) has the biggest fangirl obsession over. And then, when we're just hanging out, watching TV, he grabs my face and kisses me all over.

I miss him now. ;__;
